{"overview":"ماجراهای مأموران ویژه FBI فاکس مولدر و دانا اسکولی که پرونده‌های X‑Files را بررسی می‌کنند: پرونده‌های حاشیه‌ای و حل‌نشده‌ای که شامل پدیده‌های فراطبیعی هستند. مولدر به وجود بیگانگان و پدیده‌های فراطبیعی اعتقاد دارد، در حالی که اسکولی، یک شکوهمند، به‌عنوان تحلیل‌گر علمی مسئول بررسی کشفیات مولدر است که کارهای او را رد می‌کند و او را به پرونده‌های اصلی برمی‌گرداند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The exploits of FBI Special Agents Fox Mulder and Dana Scully who investigate X-Files: marginalized, unsolved cases involving paranormal phenomena. Mulder believes in the existence of aliens and the paranormal while Scully, a skeptic, is assigned to make scientific analyses of Mulder's discoveries that debunk Mulder's work and thus return him to mainstream cases.","tagline_en":"The truth is out there.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":122,"y":null,"poster":"/2Snk0D67ZsSoPdG88KSP1Uuedsi.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":1993,"poster":"/my640T80OJ6dekVLkBXubtIM71x.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":1994,"poster":"/8xZ1Zf82CclxaltP6grBRtR7Nwg.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":1995,"poster":"/5skcM3tQ3ThyPn1v1oLfaLkWno2.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":1996,"poster":"/cDvtQAXrcMXQJhUm5CT0r8miEsN.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":20,"y":1997,"poster":"/vsmzzFgNPXlzOywz295XbLzx2Vf.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":22,"y":1998,"poster":"/66VDHI9TwMgLleR9RD3mjMWDCC3.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":22,"y":1999,"poster":"/uwLpzy7qhKAeuViL6jJE8UEsDvU.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":21,"y":2000,"poster":"/jOzHVvM8PKtyEToE7L3H46jJicQ.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":20,"y":2001,"poster":"/d3GXgDS7oyUjwDUKoECDRF0OOZR.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":6,"y":2016,"poster":"/4Co0xiBkCRsm8hQa5JM6HUSpcAO.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":10,"y":2018,"poster":"/ooKC8WqniGNdbf9gv7neBkBPCCt.jpg"}],"episodes":218,"crew":["کریس کارتر"],"crew_en":["Chris Carter"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"دیوید دوشاونیو","role":"Fox Mu